    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dàn shì ne zhè xiē shuǐ guǒ dōu hěn zhòng āi\n但 是 呢 这 些 水 果 都 很 重 哎\nbut all this fruit is so heavy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261466,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
