    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhè ge xiāng jiāo jīn tiān yě hěn pián yi\n这 个 香 蕉 今 天 也 很 便 宜\nThe bananas are also very cheap today:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267600,
    "dDurationMs": 1866,
    "segs": [ {
