  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280500,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yì bān wǒ men bǐ jiào shén me\n一 般 我 们 比 较 什 么\nWhen we compare things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281966,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wǒ men huì shuō zhè liǎng gè nǎ ge hǎo yì diǎn\n我 们 会 说 这 两 个 哪 个 好 一 点\nwe say, “Which of these two is better?”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285933,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
