  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296100,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wǒ men bǎ zhè ge xiāng jiāo fàng jìn gòu wù chē\n我 们 把 这 个 香 蕉 放 进 购 物 车\nLet's put these bananas in the shopping cart."
