    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ó chà bu duō yǒu liǎng bàng liǎng bàng zhè yàng zi\n哦 差 不 多 有 两 磅 两 磅 这 样 子\nOh, they're about two pounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319233,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhè ge wǒ men jiào chēng zhòng chēng zhòng\n这 个 我 们 叫 称 重 称 重\nWe call this “weighing.” Weighing."
