  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326600,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "èn nà shū cài hé shuǐ guǒ qū wǒ men jiù guàng wán le\n嗯 那 蔬 菜 和 水 果 区 我 们 就 逛 完 了\nOkay, we've finished browsing the produce section."
