  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330833,
    "dDurationMs": 5133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wǒ xiàn zài yào qù zhǎo yī xià kā fēi fěn\n我 现 在 要 去 找 一 下 咖 啡 粉\nNow I'm going to look for ground coffee."
