    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rán hòu shàng miàn ne\n然 后 上 面 呢\nAnd above them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359366,
    "dDurationMs": 4434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yǒu hěn qīng chǔ de zhǐ shì pái zhǐ shì pái\n有 很 清 楚 的 指 示 牌 指 示 牌\nthere are clear aisle signs. Aisle signs."
