  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367566,
    "dDurationMs": 2367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhè yàng kě yǐ fāng biàn wǒ men qù è\n这 样 可 以 方 便 我 们 去 呃\nThat makes it easier for us to"
