  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369933,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "xún zhǎo wǒ men yào mǎi de dōng xī\n寻 找 我 们 要 买 的 东 西\nfind what we want to buy."
