  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377233,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhè ge wǒ jīng cháng mǎi zhè ge yì dà lì miàn\n这 个 我 经 常 买 这 个 意 大 利 面\nI buy this pasta often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382133,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dàn shì jīn tiān hǎo xiàng méi yǒu zhé kòu\n但 是 今 天 好 像 没 有 折 扣\nBut it doesn't seem to be on sale today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385566,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "xiàng zhè zhǒng tiē le huáng sè huáng biāo\n像 这 种 贴 了 黄 色 黄 标\nItems with a yellow label like this—"
