  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403033,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jì xù qù zhǎo kā fēi fěn\n继 续 去 找 咖 啡 粉\nLet's keep looking for ground coffee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405833,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhǎo dào le zhè lǐ yǒu hěn duō hěn duō de kā fēi\n找 到 了 这 里 有 很 多 很 多 的 咖 啡\nFound it! There are so many kinds of coffee here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409600,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wǒ yào mǎi kā fēi\n我 要 买 咖 啡\nI need to buy coffee."
