  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412566,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hǎo duō ya\n好 多 呀\nThere are so many choices!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414700,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "qí shí zhè shàng miàn de wǒ jī běn dōu hē guò\n其 实 这 上 面 的 我 基 本 都 喝 过\nActually, I've tried almost all of these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418400,
    "dDurationMs": 1733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nǐ men yǒu méi yǒu shén me tè bié\n你 们 有 没 有 什 么 特 别\nDo you have any coffee brands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420766,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tuī jiàn wǒ hē de kā fēi pǐn pái ne\n推 荐 我 喝 的 咖 啡 品 牌 呢\nthat you especially recommend?"
