  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442300,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ér qiě dōu hái shì dǎ wán zhé de\n而 且 都 还 是 打 完 折 的\nAnd these prices are after the discount."
