    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462933,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kě néng huì jīng cháng shuō de yī xiē è zhōng wén de jù zi\n可 能 会 经 常 说 的 一 些 呃 中 文 的 句 子\nthere are some Chinese sentences we may use often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467133,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bǐ rú shuō gāng cái jiào le nǐ men wǒ yào mǎi shén me\n比 如 说 刚 才 教 了 你 们 我 要 买 什 么\nFor example, I just taught you “I want to buy...”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471400,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
