  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497500,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bǐ rú shuō zhè ge shì suān nǎi suān nǎi\n比 如 说 这 个 是 酸 奶 酸 奶\nFor example, this is yogurt. Yogurt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501100,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hái yǒu yī xiē è lěng dòng de shí wù\n还 有 一 些 呃 冷 冻 的 食 物\nAnd there are some frozen foods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506133,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "zhè lǐ ne jiù shì niú nǎi niú nǎi\n这 里 呢 就 是 牛 奶 牛 奶\nHere is the milk. Milk."
