  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520166,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yīn wèi wǒ niú nǎi yě bú huì měi tiān dōu hē\n因 为 我 牛 奶 也 不 会 每 天 都 喝\nbecause I don't drink milk every day."
